Sec.  2-530.  Powers of director of human resources.
That the human resources director shall have power and shall be required to:
(1) Hold competitive examinations for all appointments  in  the  classified  service,  restricted  to persons qualified to perform the duties of the position where practicable;
(2) Give wide publicity through appropriate channels in each case to all announcements of competitive examinations to the end of encouraging qualified persons to take such examinations;
